WEBVTT
NOTE Language: en

1
00:00:03 --> 00:00:15
the lesson from the episode that you wrote to me about,

2
00:00:15 --> 00:00:23
the greatness of alacrity, of zwizos, of swiftness, schnellkeit, in all matters of goodness, not just teiromitzos,

3
00:00:23 --> 00:00:31
whenever it comes to something good, do it with great zwizos, great alacrity, great zest, and don't procrastinate.

4
00:00:31 --> 00:00:37
This, the Rebbe said, is the lesson. He didn't say how he came to determine that this is the lesson,

5
00:00:37 --> 00:00:41
but I assume, because I wrote to him the details, I remember vividly writing to him that the drive was driving so fast,
